@inherits RazorSlices.RazorSlice

@using System.Globalization
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http
@using RazorSlices

@* HeadTagHelper/BodyTagHelper are baked into the "AddRazorSupportForMvc" Razor-for-MVC toolchain RazorSlices'
   own build target requires — this disables them (Tag Helpers aren't supported in Razor Slices), per
   RazorSlices' own documented setup (https://github.com/DamianEdwards/RazorSlices#getting-started). The
   tagHelperPrefix is a second-layer safeguard: even a future @@addTagHelper here would need this prefix. *@
@tagHelperPrefix __disable_tagHelpers__:
@removeTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Razor
